  79 "Abort the running game?"
  80 "Each castle has a king, cannons, a powder store, a treasury and a mine. On your turn you may buy things (Castle menu), then you fire once.\n\nAiming: left/right = angle, Home/End = 10 degrees, up/down = charge, PgUp/PgDn = 10. Tab = next cannon, Enter = fire. Mouse: drag towards the target, right button = fire.\n\nThe wind (top right) drifts the ball. Taxes bring gold, too high taxes drive people away. Hit the king to win."
  81 "Rules"
  82 "Castle Clash 1.0 for RetroDesk 2\n\nNo coprocessor: the computer aims with test shots."
